{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethmlarson/truststore/issues/165","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethmlarson/truststore","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethmlarson/truststore/issues/165/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethmlarson/truststore/issues/165/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethmlarson/truststore/issues/165/events","html_url":"https://github.com/sethmlarson/truststore/issues/165","id":2712516660,"node_id":"I_kwDOGo9hts6hrbg0","number":165,"title":"requests 2.32.0+ does not work with truststore library","user":{"login":"timo-reymann","id":21024948,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIxMDI0OTQ4","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/21024948?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann","html_url":"https://github.com/timo-reymann","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/timo-reymann/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"closed","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":5,"created_at":"2024-12-02T16:24:16Z","updated_at":"2025-02-08T20:33:20Z","closed_at":"2025-01-13T19:05:32Z","assignee":null,"author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"## Problem\r\nStarting with the release 2.32.0 of the requests library the truststore library always leads to an recursion error. I was able to reproduce this on different Windows, Linux (Ubuntu) and macOS machines.\r\n\r\nThe crulpit seems to be the added \"preloaded ssl context\", which does not work well with truststore injection. While it seems to use urllib3 under the hood, the patched SSLContext is not really used.\r\n\r\n## Fix\r\nProposed fix is to import the `requests.adapter` package and patch the context accordingly with a truststore patched SSLContext, finished up in https://github.com/sethmlarson/truststore/pull/164\r\n\r\n## Related\r\n- https://github.com/sethmlarson/truststore/issues/155\r\n- https://github.com/sethmlarson/truststore/issues/121","closed_by":{"login":"sethmlarson","id":18519037,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4NTE5MDM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/18519037?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson","html_url":"https://github.com/sethmlarson","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sethmlarson/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/sethmlarson/truststore/issues/165/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":2,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"htt